  id: help_ruins
  displayName: The ruins and the Codex
  order: 610
  category: Late game
  icon: lore_fragment
  body: 'The deepest layer holds the rooms of a lost ant colony, still guarded. The relics and ancient tablets found there tell its story: study them in an Archive and fragments of the story appear in the Codex ({Codex}).


    The ancient research needs fragments found. Its last node unlocks the Ancient Engine: build it in the ruins and restore it step by step ({Configure} on it). A running Engine makes knowledge and doubles the Genetic Memory of this colony''s Nuptial Flight.'
  reveal: 1
